{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>1% of all net revenue from Pax Autocratica will be donated to support people forced too flee violence in conflict areas through the Norwegian Refugee Council (NRC), a politically neutral humanitarian organization assisting civilians affected by war, displacement, and oppression.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/315fa3f0b0943b10848ab8f53d5e2246.avif?t=1769467654\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras_big/315fa3f0b0943b10848ab8f53d5e2246.webp?t=1769467654 width=1560 height=131 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish the greatest regime in history in this darkly satirical colony sim + FPS roguelite hybrid. Build a prosperous totalitarian state, enforce policies, and lead your troops to victory in first-person battles. Dictate wisely as your choices will shape society, for better or worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/39e04451baf2766923372d0bfbc25fe8.avif?t=1769467654\" width=1560 height=304 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/073077c648457d490a3fd1517c78da55.poster.avif?t=1769467654\" width=780 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/073077c648457d490a3fd1517c78da55.webm?t=1769467654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/073077c648457d490a3fd1517c78da55.mp4?t=1769467654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mold your populace</strong>  by enacting tyrannical or benevolent reforms to sway your citizens\u2019 Fear, Happiness, Hunger, and Loyalty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indoctrinate them through propaganda, surveillance towers, whippings, and public executions until even their dreams serve the State.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or rise as the benevolent visionary of a new age, providing comfort, healthcare, and prosperity to those who once despaired.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decree shapes the soul of your regime, and the fate of those who live beneath it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/011d72d637db27cfdfc140d42fb9007f.avif?t=1769467654\" width=1560 height=304 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/1ef20d9b2f1f9d4977a0f941629b6511.poster.avif?t=1769467654\" width=780 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/1ef20d9b2f1f9d4977a0f941629b6511.webm?t=1769467654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/1ef20d9b2f1f9d4977a0f941629b6511.mp4?t=1769467654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your state apparatus.</strong> Turn a handful of survivors into a tightly run, self-sustaining machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your base from a cluster of shelters into an immense complex housing a growing population, each citizen serving the grand design of your regime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research new technologies, buildings, and  doctrines to refine your colony\u2019s efficiency and tighten your  control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automate production lines, streamline logistics, and watch your facilities hum with the cold precision of industry. Every upgrade is efficiency, every structure, a testament to your vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/eb939a1792e15fa36e88107f8c0e9c10.avif?t=1769467654\" width=1560 height=304 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/fb68b08012e40dea74d4f85adfb0f8c6.poster.avif?t=1769467654\" width=780 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/fb68b08012e40dea74d4f85adfb0f8c6.webm?t=1769467654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/fb68b08012e40dea74d4f85adfb0f8c6.mp4?t=1769467654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, the Leader of Auroria, will venture into the frontier of the Tyris System to conquer the fractured territories ruled by rival regimes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conscript new citizens, gather vital resources, trade with wandering merchants, and influence local populations through decisive acts that shift the balance of power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then lead your forces into battle. From desperate skirmishes to large-scale mechanized  battlefields of infantry, tanks, and mechs, each victory is another step in spreading the regime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During each expedition, choose among hundreds of roguelite buffs to forge your path toward absolute supremacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each campaign strengthens your base, your army and you, the Leader, alike: new resources, new recruits, and experience that unlocks advanced class skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two expeditions unfold the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/5a4337e73a2845d7a98ba5cbd546607c.avif?t=1769467654\" width=1560 height=304 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pax Autocratica is a totalitarian colony sim and FPS roguelite hybrid that combines base building, citizen management, and first-person tactical combat in a sci-fi dystopian world. It offers a dynamic, accessible, and approachable gameplay experience for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a game about power. How it\u2019s built, how it corrupts, and how it consumes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>You will command armies, dictate laws, and witness consequences in every face that salutes you or fears you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>THE STATE OBSERVES ALL</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How will history remember your reign?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1067360?t=1769467654","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/eaf9f9363d8efaee9b68d45c0dbc84e1fe8c53a7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1769467654","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/e894f7259f86ca304607ee68b414721e69488c77/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1769467654","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/e894f7259f86ca304607ee68b414721e69488c77/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1769467654","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This Game may contain content not appropriate for all ages, or may not be appropriate for viewing at work"},"demos":[{"appid":1069590,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>1% of all net revenue from Pax Autocratica will be donated to support people forced too flee violence in conflict areas through the Norwegian Refugee Council (NRC), a politically neutral humanitarian organization assisting civilians affected by war, displacement, and oppression.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/315fa3f0b0943b10848ab8f53d5e2246.avif?t=1769467654\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras_big/315fa3f0b0943b10848ab8f53d5e2246.webp?t=1769467654 width=1560 height=131 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Establish the greatest regime in history in this darkly satirical colony sim + FPS roguelite hybrid. Build a prosperous totalitarian state, enforce policies, and lead your troops to victory in first-person battles. Dictate wisely as your choices will shape society, for better or worse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/39e04451baf2766923372d0bfbc25fe8.avif?t=1769467654\" width=1560 height=304 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/073077c648457d490a3fd1517c78da55.poster.avif?t=1769467654\" width=780 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/073077c648457d490a3fd1517c78da55.webm?t=1769467654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/073077c648457d490a3fd1517c78da55.mp4?t=1769467654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mold your populace</strong>  by enacting tyrannical or benevolent reforms to sway your citizens\u2019 Fear, Happiness, Hunger, and Loyalty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indoctrinate them through propaganda, surveillance towers, whippings, and public executions until even their dreams serve the State.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or rise as the benevolent visionary of a new age, providing comfort, healthcare, and prosperity to those who once despaired.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decree shapes the soul of your regime, and the fate of those who live beneath it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/011d72d637db27cfdfc140d42fb9007f.avif?t=1769467654\" width=1560 height=304 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/1ef20d9b2f1f9d4977a0f941629b6511.poster.avif?t=1769467654\" width=780 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/1ef20d9b2f1f9d4977a0f941629b6511.webm?t=1769467654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/1ef20d9b2f1f9d4977a0f941629b6511.mp4?t=1769467654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build your state apparatus.</strong> Turn a handful of survivors into a tightly run, self-sustaining machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your base from a cluster of shelters into an immense complex housing a growing population, each citizen serving the grand design of your regime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Research new technologies, buildings, and  doctrines to refine your colony\u2019s efficiency and tighten your  control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automate production lines, streamline logistics, and watch your facilities hum with the cold precision of industry. Every upgrade is efficiency, every structure, a testament to your vision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/eb939a1792e15fa36e88107f8c0e9c10.avif?t=1769467654\" width=1560 height=304 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/fb68b08012e40dea74d4f85adfb0f8c6.poster.avif?t=1769467654\" width=780 height=286 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/fb68b08012e40dea74d4f85adfb0f8c6.webm?t=1769467654\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/fb68b08012e40dea74d4f85adfb0f8c6.mp4?t=1769467654\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You, the Leader of Auroria, will venture into the frontier of the Tyris System to conquer the fractured territories ruled by rival regimes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Conscript new citizens, gather vital resources, trade with wandering merchants, and influence local populations through decisive acts that shift the balance of power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Then lead your forces into battle. From desperate skirmishes to large-scale mechanized  battlefields of infantry, tanks, and mechs, each victory is another step in spreading the regime.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During each expedition, choose among hundreds of roguelite buffs to forge your path toward absolute supremacy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each campaign strengthens your base, your army and you, the Leader, alike: new resources, new recruits, and experience that unlocks advanced class skills. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two expeditions unfold the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/extras/5a4337e73a2845d7a98ba5cbd546607c.avif?t=1769467654\" width=1560 height=304 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pax Autocratica is a totalitarian colony sim and FPS roguelite hybrid that combines base building, citizen management, and first-person tactical combat in a sci-fi dystopian world. It offers a dynamic, accessible, and approachable gameplay experience for all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s a game about power. How it\u2019s built, how it corrupts, and how it consumes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>You will command armies, dictate laws, and witness consequences in every face that salutes you or fears you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>THE STATE OBSERVES ALL</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How will history remember your reign?</p>","developers":["Multiverse"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1067360/b79eeed54ef43f55ebd54f5ad7af6a0bed24719e/header.jpg?t=1769467654","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1067360/1977024919/10ca0b32645678b9762ebcd86929504071e36a67/1765816457/dash_av1.mpd?t=1765846669","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1067360/1977024919/10ca0b32645678b9762ebcd86929504071e36a67/1765816457/dash_h264.mp